---
---

<section id="about" class="section">
	<div class="container about-inner">
		<div class="section-head reveal">
			<p class="sec-label">01 — about</p>
			<h2 class="section-title">
				So, who is <span class="hl">PRABEER</span>?
			</h2>
		</div>

		<div class="about-grid bento">
			<div class="about-copy card b4 reveal">
				<p>
					I'm a cyber security learner who fell down a rabbit hole the day I realised the internet
					isn't magic — it's requests, headers, servers and assumptions. Now I spend my free time
					breaking things <em>on purpose</em>, then figuring out how to fix them.
				</p>
				<p>
					Right now I'm grinding through web application pentesting — the OWASP Top 10, Burp Suite,
					SQLmap and all the weird edge-cases in between.
				</p>
				<p class="about-actions">
					<a class="btn" href="#projects">
						see where i apply this ↓
					</a>
				</p>
			</div>

			<blockquote class="about-pull card b2 reveal">
				"i don't hack people. i hack systems —<br />
				so the good guys win."
				<footer class="about-signature mono">— PRABEER</footer>
			</blockquote>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about-inner {
		max-width: none;
	}

	.about-grid {
		max-width: 62rem;
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.about-copy {
		padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
	}

	.about-copy p {
		max-width: 58ch;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.about-copy em {
		color: var(--brand);
		font-style: normal;
	}

	.about-actions {
		margin-top: 1.4rem;
	}

	.about-pull {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.2rem);
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--text);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.about-signature {
		margin-top: 1rem;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		color: var(--brand);
	}
</style>
